Cummins Marine Service Bulletins -- Monthly Roll-Up
6BTA marine series owner subscription

Owner on file : Alden Croft (Eileen C)
Block serial  : on owner record

This month's active bulletins relevant to the 6BTA platform:

  TSB-247B   Cooling sensor false high-temperature readings,
             2006-2009 6BTA blocks. Owners experiencing
             intermittent over-temperature indication under
             steady cruise should review. Severity: advisory.
             First issued 2012, revised 2014 (B revision).

  TSB-251    Raw water pump impeller wear interval review,
             all 6BTA platforms. Recommends inspection at every
             haul-out and replacement at 1500 engine hours or
             every other haul-out, whichever comes first.

  TSB-258A   Fuel-injector timing recalibration on 2009+ blocks
             only. Not applicable to 2008-and-prior blocks.

Full text of each bulletin is available through the Cummins
QuickServe portal or by replying to this address with the
bulletin number.

This email is informational. No action is required from owners
unless you are experiencing the symptom described.

